Z||000001||ITB 2M4||11-20-2001||11:28 PM||||Welcome to the forum!<P>I've got an '84 SE that I run in the Sports Car Club of America's ITB class.  I'm using a head off of an S-10 truck, because it doesn't have the swirl vanes in the middle of the intake ports.  It's a perfect fit, and I havn't had any problems at all.  You should be able to find one at a junkyard or cyl. head shop.<P>------------------<BR>SCCA ITB '84 Fiero 2M4||||reg||1
